_:n081fc6b6b20f418a9c28cc4364a4dc03b152 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> .
<https://saref.etsi.org/core/hasStateOfInterest> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://saref.etsi.org/core/isStateOfInterestOf> .
