<https://saref.etsi.org/core/CommandExecution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes the execution of a command. Typically, its inputs and outputs are human understandable and relate to some feature of interest, such as its state (e.g., s4abcd:On), or the value of its temperature (e.g., property value 21.0 °C)."@en .
