<https://saref.etsi.org/core/Operation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "In the set of operations exposed by a smart light bulb on a given network, one may be dedicated to turn on and off the light and expect a boolean as input. Another one may be dedicated to set the luminosity status and expect a target luminosity level (a byte) and a transition time (encoded on two bytes)."@en .
